# GMS's own figures: 200+8x% on three enemies. The summon's duration is
# dropped, as every duration here is -- the shuriken simply always hangs there.
#
# 900ms between pulses is the client's own -- the shuriken's attack animation
# is six frames of 150ms, and the skill repeats that as `subTime`. The wiki
# states no rate for any summon; read the same way, Phoenix and Frostprey give
# back the 1710ms they already carry.
name: "Dark Flare"
skill_order: 3
description:
  "Hang a great shuriken of dark energy beside you that strikes nearby "
  "enemies on its own."
kind: SKILL_KIND_AUTO_ATTACK
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERMIT
max_level: 20
max_enemies: 3
cast_interval_seconds: 0.9
base { skill_pct: 2.08 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.08 }
